---
layout: base.njk
title: Works
permalink: /works/
description: "Catalog of works by Frank La Rocca: Mass settings, motets and propers, choral and instrumental music, with score previews and recordings."
---
<figure class="page-banner"><img src="/images/ghent-adoration-of-the-lamb.jpg" alt="The Adoration of the Mystic Lamb, from the Ghent Altarpiece" width="2048" height="1147" loading="eager"><figcaption>Jan van Eyck, <em>The Adoration of the Mystic Lamb</em>, 1432. &ldquo;A profound source of inspiration to me for many years.&rdquo; &mdash;&nbsp;Frank La Rocca</figcaption></figure>
<h1>Works</h1>
{%- set cats = ["Mass settings & large works", "SATB a cappella", "SSAA", "Choral–instrumental", "Propers & motets", "Chamber & orchestral"] %}
<div class="filters" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter works">
  <button class="filter is-on" data-cat="">All</button>
  {%- for cat in cats %}<button class="filter" data-cat="{{ cat }}">{{ cat }}</button>{%- endfor %}
</div>
<div class="cards" id="cards">
{%- for w in collections.work %}{% include "card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
</div>
<script>
  (function(){var fs=document.querySelectorAll('.filter'),cs=document.querySelectorAll('#cards .card');
  fs.forEach(function(f){f.addEventListener('click',function(){fs.forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('is-on')});f.classList.add('is-on');var c=f.dataset.cat;
    cs.forEach(function(k){k.hidden=!!c&&k.dataset.cats.split('|').indexOf(c)<0;});});});})();
</script>
